<title>UK: Rheinboden Hypo sets 250 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Rheinboden Hypo sets 250 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager D G Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RHEINBODEN HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.125     MATURITY    04.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  101.80    PAY DATE  S-04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    DDF	 DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 04.DEC.97 THEN STEPS UP TO 5.125 PCT IF NOT</p>
<p>		CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF 676</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
